WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.400
One shift, recorded as it happened.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.605
On site, one tap starts the shift.

3
00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:09.875
Five seconds later the office screen already shows him at work.

4
00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:13.400
Nobody refreshed the page, nobody typed anything in.

5
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.121
The proof starts with a photo.

6
00:00:15.121 --> 00:00:20.100
The camera opens inside the app: no gallery, so the picture can only be taken now.

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.390
Two breakers tripped, cables out of the trunking.

8
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.723
He writes what he found and sends it.

9
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:27.867
The phone queues it, then it goes.

10
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.256
And there it is, in the office.

11
00:00:30.256 --> 00:00:31.833
Nobody touched that page.

12
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.393
Two hours later, the same board, put right.

13
00:00:36.393 --> 00:00:38.767
Second photo, taken the same way.

14
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:44.216
Breakers reset, cables back in the trunking, the board tested and closed.

15
00:00:44.216 --> 00:00:45.900
Sent, like the first one.

16
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.498
There are the proofs.

17
00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:49.267
The second one has just landed.

18
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.311
He clocks out: two hours and fifty-three minutes.

19
00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:55.830
In the office both movements read Proved.

20
00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.533
The photos got there, so the day is covered.

21
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.450
The work is done.

22
00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.833
One button closes the job and releases the report.

23
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.913
In one ZIP.

24
00:01:06.913 --> 00:01:08.733
Closed and sealed.

25
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.514
And the client checks it alone.

26
00:01:11.514 --> 00:01:15.300
One HTML page, offline, recomputes every fingerprint.

27
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.233
A report anyone can verify.
